    "detailed_description": "<i>BeadsPopper</i> is a casual tile-matching puzzle game with a simple RPG element. Battle against adorable monster girls by popping colorful beads!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505700/extras/7c84721bc62dfbba7ca55a88332a22e7.poster.avif?t=1691143377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505700/extras/7c84721bc62dfbba7ca55a88332a22e7.webm?t=1691143377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505700/extras/7c84721bc62dfbba7ca55a88332a22e7.mp4?t=1691143377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You pop accumulating beads by matching their colors, triggering effects and fight the opponent with them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505700/extras/c78d71f9ba93270bcbcd9d7b5392aa51.poster.avif?t=1691143377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505700/extras/c78d71f9ba93270bcbcd9d7b5392aa51.webm?t=1691143377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505700/extras/c78d71f9ba93270bcbcd9d7b5392aa51.mp4?t=1691143377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique gameplay blending tile-matching puzzles with simple RPG-style battles<br></li><li>Face off against 6 animated opponents<br></li><li>Compete for high scores and times, and test your skills to the limit<br></li><li>Unlock Gallery mode to enjoy animations closely</li></ul>",
